Obelisk drives Xray-core and sing-box as separate, unmodified executables. It
does not link against them and does not redistribute them; each is downloaded
from its own upstream release and remains under its own licence:

  sing-box   GPL-3.0-or-later   https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box
  Xray-core  MPL-2.0            https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core

Docker images built from docker/Dockerfile do bundle those binaries. If you
publish such an image, you are redistributing them and their licences apply to
that image.
